<title>USA: Harcourt General buys Spanish publisher.</title>
<headline>Harcourt General buys Spanish publisher.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harcourt General Inc and Times Mirror Co said on Monday that Harcourt's publishing unit has agreed to buy Times Mirror's Spanish language medical and health sciences publisher.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Under the deal, the Harcourt unit Harcourt Brace &amp; Co, would acquire Mosby/Doyma Libros, a Spanish publisher that serves Spain, Mexico and markets in Latin America. It has annual revenues of about $14 million.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close by the end of November.</p>
</text>
